      "record_id": "1952769509254639639",
      "timestamp": "Tue Aug 05 16:31:46 +0000 2025",
      "source_type": "X",
      "raw_text": "[5:18p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite good in and out of VI, regardless of the high influx of vehicles.\n\n- Ozumba inwards Bonny Camp though on the high side is good; Ozumba inwards Law School and Adetokunbo Ademola is on the high side.\n\n- Akin Adesola is on the high side as well.\n\n- Ahmadu Bello Way is good, though slow at Eko Hotel Roundabout.\n\n- Adeola Odeku is on the high side as well. \n\n- Ajose Adeogun is good, just a bit slow at the Eko Hotel Roundabout.",
      "cleaned_text": "[5:18p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate Traffic is quite good in and out of VI, regardless of the high influx of vehicles. - Ozumba inwards Bonny Camp though on the high side is good; Ozumba inwards Law School and Adetokunbo Ademola is on the high side. - Akin Adesola is on the high side as well. - Ahmadu Bello Way is good, though slow at Eko Hotel Roundabout. - Adeola Odeku is on the high side as well. - Ajose Adeogun is good, just a bit slow at the Eko Hotel Roundabout.",
      "english_translation": "[5:18p.m.] #VI #VictoliaIIland #TrafficUpdate Traffic is quite good in and out of VI, regardless of the high influx of vehicles. - Ozumba inwards Bonny Campthough is good; Ozumba in Guard Law and Adbometoem on the high. Akinola on the high -dewell, Aduke and Adukelo goes out of the high.",
